{
  "videoId": "media:f557aea8751192b50eb2c1f093c6b14e",
  "url": "https://images-assets.nasa.gov/video/How%20Do%20We%20Do%20Research%20in%20Zero%20Gravity/How%20Do%20We%20Do%20Research%20in%20Zero%20Gravity~mobile.mp4",
  "title": "How Do We Do Research in Zero Gravity | We Asked a NASA Expert",
  "language": "en",
  "origin": "creator-captions",
  "producer": "publisher-subtitles",
  "recordedAt": "2026-11-15",
  "source": "https://images-assets.nasa.gov/video/How%20Do%20We%20Do%20Research%20in%20Zero%20Gravity/How%20Do%20We%20Do%20Research%20in%20Zero%20Gravity.srt",
  "segments": [
    {
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 3.136,
      "text": "How do we do research in zero gravity?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 3.67,
      "endSec": 5.438,
      "text": "We Asked a NASA Scientist."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 5.438,
      "endSec": 8.108,
      "text": "Actually when astronauts do experiments"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 8.108,
      "endSec": 9.542,
      "text": "on the International Space Station,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 9.542,
      "endSec": 10.176,
      "text": "for instance,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 10.176,
      "endSec": 11.644,
      "text": "to look at the effect of the space"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 11.644,
      "endSec": 13.38,
      "text": "environment on organisms,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 13.38,
      "endSec": 14.014,
      "text": "that environment"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 14.014,
      "endSec": 16.182,
      "text": "is actually technically called microgravity."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 16.182,
      "endSec": 17.884,
      "text": "That is, things feel weightless,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 17.884,
      "endSec": 18.485,
      "text": "but we're still under"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 18.485,
      "endSec": 20.186,
      "text": "the influence of Earth's gravity."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 20.186,
      "endSec": 21.421,
      "text": "Now, the very microgravity"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 21.421,
      "endSec": 22.956,
      "text": "that we're trying to study up there"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 22.956,
      "endSec": 24.09,
      "text": "can make experiments"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 24.09,
      "endSec": 25.558,
      "text": "actually really kind of difficult"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 25.558,
      "endSec": 26.693,
      "text": "for a bunch of different reasons."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 26.693,
      "endSec": 28.161,
      "text": "First of all, stuff floats."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 28.161,
      "endSec": 30.73,
      "text": "So losing things in the ISS"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 30.73,
      "endSec": 32.198,
      "text": "is a very real possibility."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 32.198,
      "endSec": 32.932,
      "text": "For example,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 32.932,
      "endSec": 34.501,
      "text": "there was a set of tomatoes"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 34.501,
      "endSec": 36.703,
      "text": "that was harvested in 2022"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 36.703,
      "endSec": 38.204,
      "text": "put it in a bag and it floated away"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 38.204,
      "endSec": 40.34,
      "text": "and we couldn't find it for eight months."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 40.34,
      "endSec": 42.175,
      "text": "So to prevent this kind of thing from happening,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 42.175,
      "endSec": 44.277,
      "text": "we use a lot of different methods, such as"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 44.277,
      "endSec": 48.348,
      "text": "using enclosed experiment spaces like glove boxes and glove bags."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 48.348,
      "endSec": 50.85,
      "text": "We use a lot of Velcro to stick stuff to."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 50.85,
      "endSec": 53.853,
      "text": "Another issue is bubbles in liquids."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 53.853,
      "endSec": 56.556,
      "text": "So, on Earth, bubbles float up,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 56.556,
      "endSec": 57.857,
      "text": "in space they don't float up,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 57.857,
      "endSec": 59.392,
      "text": "they'll interfere with optical measurements"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 59.392,
      "endSec": 61.461,
      "text": "or stop up your microfluidics."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 61.461,
      "endSec": 63.263,
      "text": "So space experiment equipment often"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 63.263,
      "endSec": 65.432,
      "text": "includes contraptions for stopping"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 65.432,
      "endSec": 67.033,
      "text": "or blocking or trapping bubbles."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 67.033,
      "endSec": 69.335,
      "text": "A third issue is convection."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 69.335,
      "endSec": 70.303,
      "text": "So on Earth,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 70.303,
      "endSec": 72.839,
      "text": "gravity drives a process of gas"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 72.839,
      "endSec": 74.474,
      "text": "mixing called convection"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 74.474,
      "endSec": 76.042,
      "text": "and that helps circulate air."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 76.042,
      "endSec": 78.878,
      "text": "But without that in microgravity we worry about"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 78.878,
      "endSec": 80.313,
      "text": "some of our experimental organisms"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 80.313,
      "endSec": 81.915,
      "text": "and whether they're going to get the fresh air"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 81.915,
      "endSec": 82.982,
      "text": "that they need."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 82.982,
      "endSec": 85.418,
      "text": "So we might do things like adding a fan to their habitat,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 85.418,
      "endSec": 87.12,
      "text": "or if we can't, we'll take their habitat"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 87.12,
      "endSec": 88.221,
      "text": "and put it somewhere"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 88.221,
      "endSec": 90.323,
      "text": "where there might already be a fan on the ISS"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 90.323,
      "endSec": 91.357,
      "text": "or in a corridor"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 91.357,
      "endSec": 93.093,
      "text": "where we think there are going to be a lot of astronauts"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 93.093,
      "endSec": 94.928,
      "text": "moving around and circulating the air."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 94.928,
      "endSec": 96.596,
      "text": "Yet another issue is the fact"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 96.596,
      "endSec": 98.198,
      "text": "that a lot of the laboratory instruments"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 98.198,
      "endSec": 100.733,
      "text": "we use on Earth are not designed for microgravity."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 100.733,
      "endSec": 102.602,
      "text": "So to ensure that gravity doesn't"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 102.602,
      "endSec": 104.237,
      "text": "play a factor in how they work,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 104.237,
      "endSec": 106.139,
      "text": "we might do experiments on the ground"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 106.139,
      "endSec": 108.241,
      "text": "where we turn them on their side or upside down,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 108.241,
      "endSec": 110.376,
      "text": "or rotate them on a rotisserie"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 110.376,
      "endSec": 111.811,
      "text": "to make sure that they keep working."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 111.811,
      "endSec": 112.712,
      "text": "So, as you can tell, for"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 112.712,
      "endSec": 114.28,
      "text": "every experiment that we do"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 114.28,
      "endSec": 115.915,
      "text": "on the International Space Station,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 115.915,
      "endSec": 117.984,
      "text": "there's a whole team of scientists"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 117.984,
      "endSec": 119.919,
      "text": "on the ground that has spent years"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 119.919,
      "endSec": 121.721,
      "text": "developing the experiment design."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 121.721,
      "endSec": 122.989,
      "text": "And so I guess the answer"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 122.989,
      "endSec": 126.059,
      "text": "to how we do research in microgravity is with a lot"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 126.059,
      "endSec": 127.16,
      "text": "of practice and preparation."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 127.694,
      "endSec": 128.895,
      "text": "We Asked a NASA Scientist."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 128.895,
      "endSec": 131.498,
      "text": "NASA. A NASA 360 Production."
    }
  ]
}
